<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMANY BEAT UKRAINE 2-0 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMANY BEAT UKRAINE 2-0 IN U-21 EUROPEAN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MEPPEN, Germany 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany beat Ukraine</p>
<p>2-0 (halftime 0-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship</p>
<p>group nine qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Markus Schroth 48, Michael Ballack 73.</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,500.</p>
<p>	 Standings	 P  W  D  L  F   A  Pts</p>
<p> 1. Germany		4  4  0  0   9  1 12</p>
<p> 2. Portugal	     5  3  0  2  10  8  9</p>
<p> 3. Ukraine		4  2  0  2   4  3  6</p>
<p> 4. Albania		4  1  0  3   5 13  3</p>
<p> 5. Armenia		3  0  0  3   5  8  0</p>
</text>
